# Git preserves bytes on add, checkout and archive, independently of core.autocrlf.
# Editors and generators own text formatting before content identities are created.
* -text -eol

# Binary artifacts always retain exact bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary

